    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587-a1">

                <pb facs="0754" n="742" xml:id="pg742"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Lend-Lease Administrator</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stettinius</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-08">January 8,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Stettinius</hi>: I have seen Senator
                    Maloney’s letter to you of December 30, 1942, and the proposed reply for your
                        signature.<anchor n="46" xml:id="d587-f1"/> I wish to assure you, as you
                    were informally assured during October, when you consulted members of the
                    Department, that on the basis of careful enquiries, we have no reason to believe
                    that the report to which the Senator refers is or has been true, and that we
                    perceive no objection from the point of view of the foreign relations of the
                    United States to the continuance of the use of the Pacific route for Soviet
                    lend-lease shipments.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cordell Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d587-f1" n="46" xml:id="d587-f1-content">
                <p>On January 15, 1943, Mr. Stettinius informed Secretary Hull that he had replied
                    to Senator Maloney.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
